            "size": {
              "h": 107,
              "w": 300
            },
            "text": "**Pixel snap** — `uv' = (floor(uv × res) + 0.5) / res`. Feed the snapped UV into the texture sample (point filtering) and every screen pixel inside a texel reads exactly that texel."
          }
        ],
